      }
    },
    "雨の記憶が多いひと月でした": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A month that remembers the rain"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "雨の通知は降り出しの約30分前(降水確率50%以上)、傘予報は毎朝7時、リマインドは連続3日以上の記録が途切れそうな夜8時に届きます。アプリを開いていない間もバックグラウンドで予報を取り直し、最新の内容に合わせて通知します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rain alerts arrive about 30 minutes before it starts (at 50% chance or higher), the umbrella forecast at 7 AM, and streak reminders at 8 PM when a streak of three or more days is about to end. The forecast refreshes in the background, so alerts stay current even when the app is closed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
